### Test login with valid credentials
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/validateController/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "string",
  "password": "string"
}

### Test login with missing username (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/validateController/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": "testPassword"
}

### Test login with missing password (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/validateController/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "testUser",
  "password": ""
}

### Test login with both username and password missing (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/validateController/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

### Test login with null request body (should fail validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/validateController/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json